sentences.text:
11. Let the applicantAmit Kumar Gautam S/o Ram Dheeraj be released on bail in the aforesaid Case Crime No. 249 of 2022, under sections 363, 366, 376, I.P.C., and sections 5, 6, Protection of Children from Sexual Offences (POCSO) Act, 2012, P.S. Haidergarh, District Barabanki, on his furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of Magistrate/Court concerned, subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.

